From d94654dbbf00a0296a53949bb7720e010a3443d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BaptGosse <baptiste.gosselin@unxwares.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:12:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(deps): update vulnerable dependencies

npm audit fix, without --force: only package-lock.json changes. npm audit goes from 48
vulnerabilities (3 critical, 23 high) to 14 (no critical, 2 high). Tests and build pass.

The two high ones left need more than a lockfile update: zod (fossflow-lib) is only fixed in
zod 4, and undici comes from the release tooling (semantic-release), not from the app.
---
